From 5b09e73f5fdde794d54baf05149458e6d00ba61c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 11:58:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Speed up first load and add free-study law badges
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Background art: 1.8MB PNG -> 125KB WebP
- Pixel font: load a 49KB subset first; full face only for missing glyphs
- Week-long browser cache for /fonts and /art; preload the subset font
- Question bank: CDN-cacheable (s-maxage 60, swr 600); admins bypass after upload
- Fetch the case generator chunk in parallel with the bank request
- Memoize student-text expansion: bank generation ~7x faster
- Free study: blinking 어렵다! on 국민건강보험법, 봉인증! on six hand-built laws

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DxiuovhRMvApyVM7uDnwEa
